<item><title>Guinea&apos;s gold mining ban drives thousands from Siguiri mining sites</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/gn/guinea-s-gold-mining-ban-drives-thousands-from-siguiri-0f025a/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/gn/guinea-s-gold-mining-ban-drives-thousands-from-siguiri-0f025a/</guid><category>Guinea</category><description>Miners and their families are leaving Kintinian and nearby gold areas after the government banned unregulated artisanal gold digging, a measure announced on 2 November.</description><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 22:38:54 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/gn/guinea-s-gold-mining-ban-drives-thousands-from-siguiri-0f025a/share.jpg" length="44304" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/gn/guinea-s-gold-mining-ban-drives-thousands-from-siguiri-0f025a/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
